      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T09:51:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually some of the calls to get devtype have prop-\u003elen \u003d 4, that have the risk of us only filling in one byte and leave the rest 3 bytes uninitialized. \nDo you think we should\n(a) Change all calls to use prop-\u003elen \u003d 1 as well?\n(b) Change all calls to initialize their prop-\u003eval to zero beforehand?\n(c) memset the prop-\u003eval to zero for the length of prop-\u003elen here?\n(d) abandon this change and just use prop-\u003elen \u003d 4 for every calls?",
      "revId": "2109b3ffecb17a287e8315fa0d2ede81020a3445",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "338ab5b7_f7ec084b",
        "filename": "system/btif/src/btif_storage.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 316,
